---
// Custom Software Detail Section
---

<section id="custom-software" class="section-padding bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
      <span class="section-label">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12.316 3.051a1 1 0 01.633 1.265l-4 12a1 1 0 11-1.898-.632l4-12a1 1 0 011.265-.633zM5.707 6.293a1 1 0 010 1.414L3.414 10l2.293 2.293a1 1 0 11-1.414 1.414l-3-3a1 1 0 010-1.414l3-3a1 1 0 011.414 0zm8.586 0a1 1 0 011.414 0l3 3a1 1 0 010 1.414l-3 3a1 1 0 11-1.414-1.414L16.586 10l-2.293-2.293a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Custom Software
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title mb-4">Software that fits <span class="gradient-text">your operations</span></h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle mx-auto">
        We design and build desktop and mobile applications for businesses and education institutions — tailored to your workflows, not the other way around.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- What We Build -->
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-20">
      <div class="card p-7 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 17.25v1.007a3 3 0 01-.879 2.122L7.5 21h9l-.621-.621A3 3 0 0115 18.257V17.25m6-12V15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 15V5.25m18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0018.75 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 5.25m18 0V12a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 12V5.25" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Desktop Applications</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Windows, macOS, and Linux applications built for daily operations — inventory, scheduling, reporting, and more.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-7 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M10.5 1.5H8.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 3.75v16.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 20.25V3.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H13.5m-3 0V3h3V1.5m-3 0h3m-3 18.75h3" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Mobile Apps</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Native and cross-platform iOS and Android apps — designed for smartphones and tablets that your team already uses.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-7 reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M11.42 15.17l-5.66-5.66a8 8 0 1111.31 0l-5.66 5.66a.5.5 0 01-.7 0z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1115 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Operations & Maintenance</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Asset tracking, work orders, preventive maintenance scheduling, and field service tools built for your specific workflows.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-7 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.75 3v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 16.5h2.25M3.75 3h-1.5m1.5 0h16.5m0 0h1.5m-1.5 0v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 16.5h-2.25m-7.5 0h7.5m-7.5 0l-1 3m8.5-3l1 3m0 0l.5 1.5m-.5-1.5h-9.5m0 0l-.5 1.5M9 11.25v1.5M12 9v3.75m3-6v6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">School Management Systems</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Student information systems, attendance tracking, grade management, and parent communication portals for education institutions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-7 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Process Automation</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Automate repetitive business processes — approvals, notifications, document generation, and data synchronization.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-7 reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M16.5 10.5V6.75a4.5 4.5 0 10-9 0v3.75m-.75 11.25h10.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Integration & APIs</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Connect your existing systems — ERP, CRM, LMS — with custom integrations and API development.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Process -->
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">How we work</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-500">From discovery to deployment, we're with you every step.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
        <div class="text-center reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-brand-600/20">1</div>
          <h5 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1 text-sm">Discovery</h5>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Understand your needs, workflows, and goals</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-brand-600/20">2</div>
          <h5 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1 text-sm">Design</h5>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">UI/UX design and technical architecture</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-brand-600/20">3</div>
          <h5 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1 text-sm">Develop</h5>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Build, test, iterate with your feedback</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-brand-600/20">4</div>
          <h5 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1 text-sm">Deploy</h5>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Launch, train your team, go live</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center col-span-2 md:col-span-1 reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-accent-600/20">5</div>
          <h5 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1 text-sm">Support</h5>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Ongoing maintenance and enhancements</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
